</span></span><span style=\"color:#3333ff;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times&\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:\\'新細明體\\',&\">新站為板橋火車站、高鐵、捷運及台汽客運站</span><span style=\"font-family:Times&\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:\\'新細明體\\',&\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#cc0000;\">，另</span><span style=\"color:#c00000;\">步行至致理技術學院、土地銀行、板橋中國信託皆於五分鐘內</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">。因室內全新裝潢，所以為維護居住品質，嚴選房客</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times&\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:\\'新細明體\\',&\">嚴禁吸煙及寵物</span><span style=\"font-family:Times&\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:\\'新細明體\\',&\">，獨立電錶</span><span style=\"font-family:Times&\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family:\\'新細明體\\',&\">度</span><span style=\"font-family:Times&\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:\\'新細明體\\',&\">元</span><span style=\"font-family:Times&\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:\\'新細明體\\',&\">。</span></span>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。\r\n本房屋近板橋轉運站公車站、文化路公車站、板橋站捷運站、板橋火車站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "板橋區民權路202巷", "lat": "25.0161880", "lng": "121.4584340", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "板橋站", "distance": 639, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約639公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "國光路站", "distance": 177, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約177公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "大庭新村(國光路)站", "distance": 201, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約201公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "湯姆熊遠東店", "distance": 841, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約841公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "小高拉麵 板橋民權店", "distance": 108, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約108公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市板橋區板橋國小後門", "distance": 458, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約458公尺"}, {"type": "university", "name": "致理科技大學", "distance": 868, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約868公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value